  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 25312727040
    m_Localized: Press {DismissPopup} to dismiss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121890770944
    m_Localized: hi! it's me, clippy. it looks like you're having trouble aiming.
      press {CameraLock} to lock on, you sick fuck. Also use {Move} to move around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 41735929565184
    m_Localized: 'Now entering: Petrichor Landing.

      Your mission: Find and
      destroy the False Idol, and any errant Angels you come across.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43201415188480
    m_Localized: Use {Fire1} and {Fire2} to shoot. Your mech can automatically aim
      by pressing {CameraLock} if enemies are in range of your weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80781078794240
    m_Localized: The beam emanating from an Angel's eye glows brightly as it is about
      to attack. Quickly tap and release {Dodge}, and your mech will dodge in the
      direction it's moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88040836009984
    m_Localized: Your mech is equipped with a set of powerful boosters that activate
      by pressing {Jump}. Double tapping {Hover} midair will toggle hover mode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88926194864128
    m_Localized: Jumping - but not hovering - consumes BOOST. BOOST recharges when
      your mech lands on the ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91091038736384
    m_Localized: Hold {Sprint} while on the ground to sprint. Sprinting allows for
      fast, grounded traversal at the cost of accuracy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
